    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You shape chakra into a scalpel, a tourniquet, and a sutures kit. Tsunade-trained medical-nin can mend organs that would otherwise stop, rebuild bone fragments, and (with enough chakra reserves) refuse to let a dying ally cross over.</p>\n<p><strong>Hit Points</strong> 8 + Constitution</p>\n<p><strong>Key Attribute</strong> Wisdom</p>\n<p><strong>Initial Proficiencies</strong> trained in simple weapons and unarmed attacks; trained in light/medium armor and unarmored defense; expert Fortitude and Will, trained Reflex; trained in Medicine plus 5 additional skills</p>\n<p><strong>Spellcasting</strong> full chakra caster; spell DCs and attack rolls use Wisdom; tradition is chakra. Your jutsu favor the <em>healing</em>, <em>vitality</em>, and <em>poison</em> traits.</p>\n<p>At 1st level you gain the shared chakra-core features plus @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-shinobi.class-features.Item.ClFtMedicalSpc00]{Medical Specialization} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-shinobi.class-features.Item.ClFtMedicalPth00]{Medical Discipline}.</p>"
    },
